  "disposition": "EXACT_IDENTITY_OBSERVER_RECURSION_KERNEL_AND_REALIZED_IMAGE_QUOTIENT_EQUIVALENCE_SPLIT_UNCOMPILED",
  "conceptual_split_decision": "Separate complete identity-recursion/kernel-equality mathematics from its full quotient/image equivalence. Keep the private trace lemma and the only theorem calling it in one module; the second needs only the public exact equivalence theorem. Preserve original open directives and universe uQ exactly.",
  "premise_review": [
    "All2542B original and4181B organized bytes separately read, including every private theorem and every Quotient.map/equivalence proof. No imported theorem bodies count as primary credit.",
    "quantizerIdentitySystem keeps arbitrary State:Type uQ,m/n:Nat,Q:Quantizer State m n; Input/Resolution are PUnit,step ignores input and preserves state,observe is Q.encode. No finite,nonempty,injective or surjective State/encoder assumption is inserted.",
